 "tips": [
  "Hold SEL and turn SELECT to wrap the pattern round: the steps slide along and come back at the other end",
  "Hold ENV or SEL while you press a key to write the note with an accent or a slide",
  "PLAY view: press white keys to cue patterns. They play in the order you pressed, each when the one before ends. Hold ENV to accent everything",
  "Pages 5 and 6 of the knobs are the switches, drawn as switches: turn a knob right to flip one up",
  "Hold SEL on a project in the project list to copy it, hold EDIT to start it over",
  "Send MIDI clock and the FM-1 follows it. The tempo turns blue",
  "GLO + HOME is the menu. Roll The Dice fills every pattern of every project with random stuff: hold OCT+ to confirm"
